{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53498","headline":"紫阁 · 薛昌朝","name":"紫阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁下寒溪涨碧湍，阁前苍翠数峯环。\n危梯续蹬穿松外，细竹分泉落石间（卷九作「前」）。\n好鸟啁啾争唤客，乱云开合巧藏山。\n独来应爲禅僧笑，少有人能伴我闲。\n（《类编长安志》卷三、卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昌朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}